("ADV-028",NC,"'Annually' already means every year.","ANNUAL-LY: ANNUS = year.","'Annual' is the adjective: 'annual leave', 'annual report'.","Write a sentence about something you do annually.",None,"annually vs yearly","Same meaning. Annually is more formal."),
