("ADV-032","carefully – more carefully – most carefully","To describe how she listens, use the adverb 'carefully'.","CAREFUL + LY: double L.","'Handle carefully' is printed on fragile boxes.","Write a sentence about something you do carefully.",None,"carefully vs careful","Careful = adjective (be careful). Carefully = adverb (drive carefully)."),
("ADV-033","carelessly – more carelessly – most carelessly","To describe how he drives, use the adverb 'carelessly'.","CARELESS + LY: CARE-LESS-LY.","'Carelessly' often goes with mistakes and accidents.","Write a sentence about something done carelessly.",None,"carelessly vs careless","Careless = adjective (a careless driver). Carelessly = adverb (drives carelessly).","He drives careless.","He drives carelessly."),
